    "said before, a design or rename, 'from now on', 'do this yourself'. A task inside a project as it stands "
    "(fix this bug in that repo, run that command, write this copy) is not one. The bracketed word is the "
    "project the owner was in: a defect or missing feature in the repo that holds the system's own tooling, "
    "rules or loop is an improvement ask even when it reads as a bug report.")
DIMS = {
